{"full":"hf:baka999/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora-UNCENSORED","spaceId":"baka999/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora-UNCENSORED","name":"MiniMax H3 Turbo LoRA","source":"huggingface","description":"Video generation with a synchronized soundtrack","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":14,"created":"2026-10-07T16:25:16.000Z","updated":"2026-10-09T21:37:31.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://baka999-minimax-h3-turbo-lora-uncensored.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/baka999/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora-UNCENSORED","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T16:56:43.672Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T16:56:43.672Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T16:56:43.672Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🎬","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This Space generates video and its soundtrack using the public MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3 checkpoint. The transformer runs in bfloat16 without quantization; the video and audio VAEs stay in float32. The latter is intentional: the released autoencoders declare keepinfp32modules, and forcing the audio VAE to bf16 affected volume in the original deployment's tests.","The local pipeline contains the transformer, two VAEs and schedulers. A remote qwen3vl-conditioner Space produces the text and image embeddings for every request, including when prompt upsampling is disabled. Prompts and uploaded keyframes or reference media are therefore sent to that service; cloning this repository does not create an offline application. Mixed-reference mode reuses the current FL2VA weights and is experimental; it does not download the separately trained transformerref checkpoint."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/baka999/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora-UNCENSORED/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"dcbc4af044b339f5087a59fb1bebec25db95c4c04161e9912e2094cb71efe9be","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T16:56:43.703Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2